{
    "background_story": "Hunky was a former professional wrestler known for his incredible strength and agility. But it was his right arm that made him a legend in the ring. Dubbed 'The Cannon', Hunky's arm was capable of delivering devastating blows that could knock opponents off their feet. His finishing move, 'The Armageddon', was a signature armbar that left opponents reeling. After a career-ending injury, Hunky retired from wrestling and opened his own gym, where he trained a new generation of athletes. Though he never forgot his wrestling roots, Hunky's true pride was in helping others build their own strength and confidence. His iconic arm, once a symbol of destruction, had become a symbol of inspiration and guidance.",
